    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "Hozayi",
      "rationale": "חוזי tɔgɔ josiraw bɛ fɔ 'seerw sɛbɛn' (חוזים jate cogo kelen na) walima tɔgɔ-ɲɛmɔgɔ Hozayi ye"
